# Cursor/Windsurf Agent Rules (.cursorrules)

Refer to [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md) in the project root for the canonical build commands, testing instructions, directory layout, and strict ontological principles (defined in [CONSTITUTION.md](./CONSTITUTION.md)).

## Quick Commands
* Run quality gate: `make check`
* Run tests: `make test`
* Format code: `make fmt`
* Compile mappings: `make compile-mappings`
* Compile statements: `make compile-statements`
